WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:04.500
Title: Chalkroom. A different AI assistant for every subject.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.800
One chatbot trying to handle every subject at once gets overloaded.

00:12.500 --> 00:21.800
So we built a team. A router sends each question to the right specialist. Calc takes the math question.

00:23.000 --> 00:29.600
Talk to the site and it listens: change the background, find a keyboard, add it to the cart.

00:29.800 --> 00:32.000
Every subject gets its own teacher.
